_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lune_chocolat/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f7fc8b0/uploads/origins/07bbc042-cecc-4af7-83df-74fb8babd258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1644dca5bddcb9585a7179c9b3e30d86", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6f7fc8b0/uploads/origins/07bbc042-cecc-4af7-83df-74fb8babd258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1644dca5bddcb9585a7179c9b3e30d86, https://si.imgix.net/6f7fc8b0/uploads/origins/07bbc042-cecc-4af7-83df-74fb8babd258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a70317ce986b275242d747dcc7ce2ea4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6f7fc8b0/uploads/origins/07bbc042-cecc-4af7-83df-74fb8babd258?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=975edb668af9daa991d4bde119176d20 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵は本当にかわいいです、\n僕のvtuberのハピを描いてくれませんか？\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/11eBHtyXrbfEtySiZR8KxN7fhQv_C3-0h/view?usp=sharing\nかわいいポーズと巫女服をお願いします。これに似てます。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1v_d88FMnyf5MV-r-ptwLPG51dLzl6f7Q/view?usp=sharing\nシンプルでかわいい背景をお願いします。\n透明バージョンもお願いします！\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lune_chocolat/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/791655e3/uploads/origins/30e0141e-9af0-4cbd-b7c1-bbf197123ec2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc231c28735158a2d8ea8f8d6235ec9d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/791655e3/uploads/origins/30e0141e-9af0-4cbd-b7c1-bbf197123ec2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc231c28735158a2d8ea8f8d6235ec9d, https://si.imgix.net/791655e3/uploads/origins/30e0141e-9af0-4cbd-b7c1-bbf197123ec2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12afa97106f5f9c8d67d1346e1819450 2x, https://si.imgix.net/791655e3/uploads/origins/30e0141e-9af0-4cbd-b7c1-bbf197123ec2?bg=%23fff&auto=form